---
// Google-Ads-Landingpage „Badsanierung + Ort" → /angebot/badsanierung-<ort>.
// noindex + nicht in Sitemap (siehe LandingLayout + astro.config.mjs). Ein Ziel: Anfrage.
// Datengetrieben aus src/data/ads.ts — neuer Ort = 1 Zeile in badsanierungTowns.
import LandingLayout from '../../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
import LandingForm from '../../components/LandingForm.astro';
import UspGrid from '../../components/UspGrid.astro';
import FaqAccordionV2 from '../../components/FaqAccordionV2.astro';
import { badsanierung, badsanierungTowns, withOrt } from '../../data/ads';
import { site } from '../../data/site';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return badsanierungTowns.map((t) => ({ params: { ort: t.slug }, props: { town: t } }));
}

const { town } = Astro.props;
const ort = town.name;
const formName = `ads-badsanierung-${town.slug}`;

const h1 = withOrt(badsanierung.h1Template, ort);
const title = withOrt(badsanierung.titleTemplate, ort);
const description = withOrt(badsanierung.metaDescriptionTemplate, ort);

// Benefits mit ersetztem {ort} in die UspGrid-Form bringen.
const benefits = badsanierung.benefits.map((b) => ({ title: b.title, text: withOrt(b.text, ort) }));
const steps = badsanierung.steps.map((s) => ({ title: s.title, text: withOrt(s.text, ort) }));
const faq = badsanierung.faq.map((f) => ({ q: withOrt(f.q, ort), a: withOrt(f.a, ort) }));
---
<LandingLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- HERO mit Headline + Formular (above the fold) -->
  <LandingForm
    withEmail={true}
    title={badsanierung.formTitle}
    subject={`Badsanierung-Anfrage (${ort}) über hepabaut.de`}
    formName={formName}
  >
    <div slot="above-form" class="lp-hero-head">
      <div class="accent-line-2 center"></div>
      <h1 class="display-1">{h1}</h1>
      <p class="lp-hero-sub">{badsanierung.subline}</p>
      <ul class="lp-badges">
        {badsanierung.trustBadges.map((b) => (
          <li class="lp-badge">{b}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </LandingForm>

  <!-- NUTZEN / TRUST -->
  <UspGrid
    heading={badsanierung.benefitsHeading}
    usps={benefits}
    ctaVariant="buttons-row-phone"
    ctaLabel="Kostenloses Angebot"
    ctaHref="#form-hero"
    telHref={`tel:${site.phonePrimaryHref}`}
  />

  <!-- ABLAUF -->
  <section class="section pd-80px lp-process">
    <div class="container-default w-container">
      <div class="text-center-2 mg-bottom-48px">
        <div class="accent-line-2 center"></div>
        <h2 class="display-5">{badsanierung.processHeading}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-steps">
        {steps.map((s) => (
          <div class="lp-step">
            <h3 class="lp-step__title">{s.title}</h3>
            <p class="lp-step__text">{s.text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="lp-process__cta">
        <a href="#form-hero" class="btn-primary w-button">Jetzt kostenloses Angebot sichern</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <FaqAccordionV2 heading={faq.length ? badsanierung.faqHeading : ''} items={faq} />

  <style is:global>
    .lp-hero-head { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 28px; }
    .lp-hero-head .display-1 { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .lp-hero-sub {
      color: var(--neutral--700, #353535);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 620px;
    }
    .lp-badges {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 22px 0 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px 14px;
    }
    .lp-badge {
      font-family: 'Onest', sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--secondary--color-1, #063137);
      background: var(--neutral--100, #fff);
      border: 1px solid var(--neutral--300, #eee);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(6, 49, 55, 0.06);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 16px 8px 34px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .lp-badge::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      top: 50%;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent--primary-1, #06c35d);
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }
    .lp-process { background: var(--neutral--200, #f7f7f7); }
    .lp-steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .lp-step {
      background: var(--neutral--100, #fff);
      border: 1px solid var(--neutral--300, #eee);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .lp-step__title {
      font-family: 'Onest', sans-serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--secondary--color-1, #063137);
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .lp-step__text { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
    .lp-process__cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; }
    @media (max-width: 991px) {
      .lp-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 479px) {
      .lp-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .lp-hero-sub { font-size: 17px; }
    }
  </style>
</LandingLayout>
